<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korea to provide five trln won for holidays.</title>
<headline>South Korea to provide five trln won for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's central Bank of Korea said on Thursday it would pump in about five trillion won into the economy ahead of the Korean Thanksgiving holidays to meet the seasonal rise in money demand.</p>
</text>
